{"kind":"article","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/Installation","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"text":"Add YBVRAppleSDK to your iOS or visionOS project.","type":"text"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Getting Started","generated":true,"anchor":"Getting-Started","identifiers":["doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/QuickStart"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"YBVRAppleSDK is delivered as a self-contained Swift package that wraps pre-built","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"XCFrameworks. You do not build the SDK from source, and you do not need access to the SDK’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"own repositories — YBVR provides you with a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"YBVRAppleSDK"},{"text":" directory containing everything","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"required.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Requirements","anchor":"Requirements","type":"heading","level":3},{"rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Platform","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Minimum OS","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Xcode","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"iOS","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"17.0","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"16.2 or later","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"visionOS","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"26.0","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"26.0 or later","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"header":"row","type":"table"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"An Apple silicon Mac is required to build.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Step 1 — Obtain the SDK Package","anchor":"Step-1-Obtain-the-SDK-Package","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"YBVR delivers the SDK as a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"YBVRAppleSDK"},{"text":" directory with this layout:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":null,"code":["YBVRAppleSDK\/","├── Package.swift            \/\/ declares every binary target","├── frameworks\/              \/\/ the XCFrameworks the package wraps","│   ├── YBVRAppleSDK.xcframework","│   ├── KSPlayer.xcframework","│   ├── Yams.xcframework","│   ├── FFmpegKit.xcframework","│   └── … Libav*, libass, Libsw* …","├── Examples\/                \/\/ runnable iOS and visionOS demo apps","│   ├── common               \/\/ playback code both demos share","│   ├── iOS\/DemoApp","│   └── visionOS\/DemoApp","└── docs\/                    \/\/ offline copy of this reference"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Every XCFramework covers device and simulator for both iOS and visionOS, so one package","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"serves every build configuration.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Important","style":"important","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Keep the ","type":"text"},{"code":"frameworks","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" directory next to ","type":"text"},{"code":"Package.swift","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". The package refers to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"each XCFramework by relative path, and moving or flattening the directory breaks resolution.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Place the directory anywhere inside — or alongside — your project. A common choice is a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Vendor\/"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ThirdParty\/"},{"text":" folder in your repository root.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Step 2 — Add the Package to Your Project","anchor":"Step-2-Add-the-Package-to-Your-Project","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In Xcode:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Select "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"File ▸ Add Package Dependencies…","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Click "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Add Local…","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" in the bottom-left of the dialog."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Choose the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"YBVRAppleSDK"},{"type":"text","text":" directory (the one containing "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Package.swift"},{"type":"text","text":") and click"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Add Package","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In the target chooser, add the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"YBVRAppleSDK"},{"type":"text","text":" library product to your app target."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To reference it from your own Swift package instead, declare it as a local path dependency:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["dependencies: [","    .package(path: \"Vendor\/YBVRAppleSDK\")","],","targets: [","    .target(","        name: \"MyApp\",","        dependencies: [","            .product(name: \"YBVRAppleSDK\", package: \"YBVRAppleSDK\")","        ]","    )","]"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The product bundles every binary target the SDK needs, so this single dependency is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"sufficient — you never list ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"KSPlayer"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Yams"},{"text":", or the FFmpeg targets yourself.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Step 3 — Confirm the Link","anchor":"Step-3-Confirm-the-Link","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Add the import to any Swift file and build:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import YBVRAppleSDK"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The XCFrameworks come in through the package, and Xcode links and embeds whatever they need","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"for you, so there is no “Embed & Sign” step to configure. If Xcode reports missing symbols at","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"link time, the usual cause is that the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"YBVRAppleSDK"},{"text":" library product was not added to the target in Step 2.4 — check","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Target ▸ General ▸ Frameworks, Libraries, and Embedded Content","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Step 4 — Run a Demo App","anchor":"Step-4-Run-a-Demo-App","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The delivered package includes working demo apps for both platforms under ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Examples\/"},{"text":". They","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are the fastest way to confirm your setup and to see the integration patterns in context:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Examples\/iOS\/DemoApp\/DemoApp.xcodeproj"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Examples\/visionOS\/DemoApp\/DemoApp.xcodeproj"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Both projects already reference the delivered package by relative path, so they build as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"delivered without further configuration — leave the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Examples"},{"text":" directory inside the package.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Next Steps","anchor":"Next-Steps","type":"heading","level":2},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/QuickStart","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — load configuration, create a player, and start streaming."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ybvrapplesdk\/installation"]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","title":"Installation","modules":[{"name":"YBVRAppleSDK"}],"role":"article"},"references":{"doc://applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK/documentation/YBVRAppleSDK":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"YBVR Apple SDK for streaming and displaying VR video on iOS and visionOS.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK","title":"YBVRAppleSDK","url":"\/documentation\/ybvrapplesdk","role":"collection"},"doc://applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK/documentation/YBVRAppleSDK/QuickStart":{"role":"article","url":"\/documentation\/ybvrapplesdk\/quickstart","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Get up and running with YBVR video playback in your iOS or VisionOS app."}],"kind":"article","title":"Quick Start","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/QuickStart","type":"topic"}}}